Package: cnp
Title: Clinical Neuropsychology Psychometrics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Giorgio", "Arcara", , "giorgio.arcara@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for psychometrics and normative data modelling in clinical
    neuropsychology. It includes regression-based adjustment methods
    (Arcara 2024, Capitani 1987), the Equivalent Scores classification
    method, and data-simulation helpers for testing and teaching these
    methods.
